      "content": "but i cant just \"stop\" for a bit. the moment i pause, the bills pile up even faster and then i'm even further behind. it’s not like a vacation... it’s like the math of my whole life just doesn't work anymore. no matter how hard i run, the numbers always end up in the red. it feels like there's no way out of the math.",
